  <item>
    <title>品鉴说唱歌词后的深意 rapeter 派克特（cold word）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671e6a8844ae79002c76bc46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671e6a8844ae79002c76bc46</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 16:29:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说唱歌手被诟病的最多的就是歌词，有人就说了这帮说唱歌手能不能别给我们喂狗屎了，其实恰恰相反，许多有深意的我们大多时候都没get到，今天咱们一起get一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>我准备好了——rapeter</span></p><span></span><p><span>没错我跳过了海选，</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为链子，本来就该在我脖子上，</span></p><span></span><p><span>海外比了六轮，</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以我在这里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>What’s wrong，</span></p><span></span><p><span>当mic check，</span></p><span></span><p><span>I'm like chef,</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲究合适量，</span></p><span></span><p><span>出锅撒点punchline(点睛之笔)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>My verse done,</span></p><span></span><p><span>中文Hip-hop，</span></p><span></span><p><span>总是被洋流推，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我承认也曾经渴望着，</span></p><span></span><p><span>趴到墙头愧，</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人在床颓废，</span></p><span></span><p><span>靠床头柜躺床头睡，</span></p><span></span><p><span>而有人选择把他梦想，</span></p><span></span><p><span>装进黄头盔，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Respect(尊敬)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>永远不会浪费我的verse(主歌)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Trap drill jersey club,</span></p><span></span><p><span>不上最火的车，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mercy(说唱歌手)说Rapeter吴嘉轩太难记，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我回答don’t worry(别担心)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们拼错我的名字，</span></p><span></span><p><span>却能唱对我的歌，</span></p><span></span><p><span>没例外，</span></p><span></span><p><span>哥们堆积rhyme(押韵)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>My daily life,</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的主场，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bpm from one hundred to eighty-five,</span></p><span></span><p><span>轨道夯实的高铁，</span></p><span></span><p><span>总有天会比飞机快，</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年再拿一个冠，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是我年初定的KPI(绩效)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>I ’m ready for this，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for that,</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然我也，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for diss,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for laugh,</span></p><span></span><p><span>(准备迎接嘲讽)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>听得多了，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rapeter吴嘉轩this(这些)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rapeter吴嘉轩that(那些)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我只想把中文new boombap(音乐风格)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>盖上Rapeter吴嘉轩tag(标签)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cuz I’m ready for this，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for that,</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然我也，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for diss,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for laugh,</span></p><span></span><p><span>听得多了，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rapeter吴嘉轩this(这些)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rapeter吴嘉轩that(那些)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>二零二四，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rapeter吴嘉轩back(回来了)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你们得，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ready for that,</span></p><span></span><p><span>New boombap,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Back it up,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pack it up,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rapeter吴嘉轩纽约的背包客，</span></p><span></span><p><span>包里面东西变heavier(更重)，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我更加微笑着，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我十二个海外的兄弟，</span></p><span></span><p><span>全都没拿链子，</span></p><span></span><p><span>没事儿明年我当导师，</span></p><span></span><p><span>让他们也回到这，</span></p><span></span><p><span>得要trust二零二四，</span></p><span></span><p><span>必定是new boombap(音乐风格)的花季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我向我自己答应，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我看着镜子，</span></p><span></span><p><span>可镜子里面的他信了，</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以不好意思，</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年冠军哥们儿拿定了，</span></p><span></span><p><span>Time.</span></p><span></span><p><span>cold word——派克特</span></p><span></span><p><span>It’s a cold world but I made hot shit</span></p><span></span><p><span>So I hit the real rhyme better than you pop shit</span></p><span></span><p><span>我听到你心里在喊着发了 yeah</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为你们也知道是谁的 rap shit</span></p><span></span><p><span>没用全力就已经到 top shit</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为太多人每天在 talk